error[RB0107]: type parameter `Order` has the name of a record type `Order`
 --> RB0107-type-parameter-named-like-a-type.road:2:11
  |
1 | type Order { id: string }
  |      ----- declared here
2 | type Page<Order> { items: Order[] }
  |           ^^^^^
  |
  = help: a type parameter cannot have the name of a declaration; `T`, `U` and so on are usual
